Z||000000||Formula 18||02-01-2001||11:25 PM||||How can you tell if you need to rebuild a turbo? I have done the basic spin the blade with something soft but ther IS a LITTLE play in the wheels side to side; not much but if you push the move just a little. Is this cause there is Oil in there when they spin on the car? <P>What a re the tolerance for bearing play, and that sort of stuff?? Anyonw know?<P>BTW it is a Garrett T-3 with .63 AR and a 60 trim. <P>Thanks<BR>Brain <P>P.S. Trav I hope you'll read this and tell me if you still have thoes two T-too small... I meanT-25's for sale? <BR>If so, how much?||||reg||1
Z||000001||rogergarrison||02-02-2001||01:42 AM||||ive been told best way is to check for oil in intake tubes or air cleaner assembly. ||||reg||1
