Z||000003||1FST2M6||02-02-2001||08:15 AM||||T-28 super 60. they are the same housing just a smaller exhaust wheel with a larger (dual blade) intake/compressor wheel. there should be a little play in the wheels but not enough to clip the housing. does it grind on the housing? I have 2 of the T-28s. you'll have to make a new down pipe they aren't direct replacements. i'll e-mail you  pics and details if you want.  i also have 1 T-04e... you'd be the MAN with one of those! you'd be really hard pressed to even come close to pushing a T-04 hard!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   pics to follow soon. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg"> ||||reg||1
